      "date": "2026-08-31 07:08:23.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nThe conditional behaves as described - I reproduced the target resolution with a stand-in autoMakefile and confirmed that plain 'make', 'make install' and 'make dist' no longer see two cscope recipes, that 'make cscope' and 'make cscope mkid' still get this recipe, and that tags/TAGS/ctags/CTAGS merge without a warning. Two non-blocking comments inline.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
