      "commit": {
        "parents": [
          {
            "commit": "dd48e6b096c367e5dfac9bac34641f7691cf9908",
            "subject": "LU-20438 lnet: Implement LNet support for PCI P2P DMA"
          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Oleg Drokin",
          "email": "green@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-30 22:24:50.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Oleg Drokin",
          "email": "green@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-30 22:24:50.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-17000 build: do not define cscope twice",
        "message": "LU-17000 build: do not define cscope twice\n\nThe old autoMakefile.am defined its own cscope target, which kept\nautomake from generating one.  The refactor below moved the tags rules\nout to config/Makefile.codetags, which the top-level Makefile includes\nafter autoMakefile, so they now override the cscope recipe automake\ngenerates and every build that reads autoMakefile warns twice:\n\n  config/Makefile.codetags:29: warning: overriding recipe for target 'cscope'\n  autoMakefile:819: warning: ignoring old recipe for target 'cscope'\n\ncscope is the only collision.  automake's tags, TAGS, ctags and CTAGS\nrules carry prerequisites but no recipe of their own, so the codetags\nrules merge with them, and automake has no etags or mkid target at all.\n\nDefine the cscope recipe only when autoMakefile is not in\nMAKEFILE_LIST, which covers both the interactive targets and an\nunconfigured tree where the include found nothing, or when cscope was\nnamed on the command line anyway.  'make', 'make install' and 'make\nrpms' are then warning free and 'make cscope' still gets this recipe.\nThe rest of the file stays unconditional, so a mixed 'make install\nmkid' keeps every tags target it has today; only a mixed 'make install\ncscope' asks for both cscope recipes at once, and that one still\nresolves here and still warns, exactly as it does now.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 4ff30bece12c (\"LU-18687 build: refactor the top-level Makefile\")\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I49be95bb7c98a20bf62c0116225ea8baff770b29\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
